{"id":"c7b60f88c2f6fa90","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-prop-vopenka.md","title":"Vopěnka's Principle Formulation","display":"prop-vopenka — Vopěnka's Principle Formulation","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-vopenka","aliases":["58-prop-vopenka"],"display":"prop-vopenka — Vopěnka's Principle Formulation","depends_on":["[[58-df-language]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-vopenka"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-vopenka</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-vopenka — Vopěnka's Principle Formulation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"58-df-language\">58-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in V\">\\(L\\in V\\)</span> is a first-order language and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> is a metalinguistic class variable.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> are the exact predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\">\\(\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\\)</span> denotes quantification over definable classes and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VP}\">\\(\\mathrm{VP}\\)</span> denotes Vopěnka's principle.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}vopenka}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\\mathcal C\\;\\forall L\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\in V\\;(\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C\\to\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L))\n\\to\\exists\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,j\\in V\\;(\n\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\mathcal A\\neq\\mathcal B\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B))\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}vopenka}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\\mathcal C\\;\\forall L\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\in V\\;(\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C\\to\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L))\n\\to\\exists\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,j\\in V\\;(\n\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\mathcal A\\neq\\mathcal B\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B))\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vopěnka's principle is far stronger than the existence of a single supercompact cardinal.</li>\n<li>The formulation is explicitly metatheoretic and class-level: it does not reify a proper class of structures as a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}vopenka}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VP}\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall_{\\mathsf{Class}}\\mathcal C\\;\\forall L\\in V\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\in V\\;(\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal C\\to\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal A,L))\n\\to\\exists\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,j\\in V\\;(\n\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\mathcal A\\neq\\mathcal B\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B))\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4014","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-prop-vopenka.md|58-prop-vopenka]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d81b1b2123168018","d9b8711cda3f31ca","a25c0a66cf56c0f4","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}